### 📊 Secrets Security Checklist

| Check | Status | Recommendation |
|-------|--------|----------------|
| Secrets not in version control | ❌ | Add `.env*` to `.gitignore` |
| Secrets encrypted at rest | ❌ | Use AWS Secrets Manager / Vault |
| Proper file permissions | ❌ | `chmod 600 .env*` |
| Access logging | ❌ | Use secrets manager with audit logs |
| Secret rotation | ❌ | Implement rotation strategy |
| Principle of least privilege | ❌ | Use IAM roles, not static keys |
| Environment separation | ❌ | Different secrets per environment |

